<title>Todo App</title>
<style>
  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, sans-serif; background: #f0f2f5; color: #333; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; justify-content: center; padding: 40px 20px; }
